# Local OpenTofu/Terraform files
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.backup
*.tfvars
.terraform/
.tofu/


# Credentials and local environment variables.
# `.env*` not `.env` (F54): `.env.local`, `.env.bak`, `.env.prod`, `.env.save` and every
# per-directory equivalent were all committable. Found by making exactly such a backup while
# cleaning F52 -- taking a copy before editing a secrets file is what a careful person does.
.env*
!.env.example
aws_creds

# OpenTofu plan artifacts. S1-T4 creates both by these exact names, and a saved plan renders
# every value BR-D4 forbids on a public repo -- account id, role ARNs, bucket names, the
# collection endpoint. Ephemeral on a runner; a disclosure in a working tree.
tfplan
plan.json

# Python environment. Both spellings: `venv/` does NOT match `.venv/`, and
# `environments/ai-lab/.venv/` is ignored today only because `python -m venv` happens to write
# its own `.gitignore` inside it. Recreate it with a tool that does not and ~4,000 files
# become stageable.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
venv/
.venv/

# way-of-working dev-workflow state.
# `.ai/next-steps.md` and `.ai/project.yml` ARE tracked -- they are the shared cursor and
# the plugin contract. These two are per-machine session state, not shared record.
.ai/state.json
.ai/archive/

# Claude Code local overrides. `.claude/settings.json` IS tracked -- it pins the
# way-of-working plugin version for everyone working in this repo.
.claude/settings.local.json